[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3061.23, "timestamp": "00:51:01", "text": "媒体。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3065.99, "timestamp": "00:51:05", "text": "那我先去睡觉了。实际上，可能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3069.309, "timestamp": "00:51:09", "text": "或许今天不会有直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3072.79, "timestamp": "00:51:12", "text": "好吧，我知道我又要推迟了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3075.829, "timestamp": "00:51:15", "text": "此外，健康仍然很重要。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3077.63, "timestamp": "00:51:17", "text": "我觉得我应该只直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3081.43, "timestamp": "00:51:21", "text": "它。一旦我熟练了，我直播的时间也会更长。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3083.27, "timestamp": "00:51:23", "text": "更健康。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3085.549, "timestamp": "00:51:25", "text": "否则我就可以直播了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3088.71, "timestamp": "00:51:28", "text": "今天不仅如此，我的身体也更疲惫了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3089.71, "timestamp": "00:51:29", "text": "和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3093.27, "timestamp": "00:51:33", "text": "就去睡觉，躺着吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3095.309, "timestamp": "00:51:35", "text": "躺下，然后睡着了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3102.71, "timestamp": "00:51:42", "text": "是啊，不过还是要谢谢你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3105.349, "timestamp": "00:51:45", "text": "现在正从我身边经过。真的很有趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3107.51, "timestamp": "00:51:47", "text": "嗯。祝您工作顺利，效率满满！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3111.19, "timestamp": "00:51:51", "text": "星期一即将到来。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3112.95, "timestamp": "00:51:52", "text": "那么，就此打住，我们今天就到这里。"}]